{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42443","headline":"送锺员外 · 孙岘","name":"送锺员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万物中萧洒，修篁独逸羣。\n贞姿曾冒雪，高节欲凌云。\n细韵风初发，浓烟日正曛。\n因题偏惜别，不可暂无君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙岘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}